</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>A pair containing the deformed normal projection tensor and its derivative with respect to FInv</para>
</simplesect>
The deformed normal projection tensor is defined as:    <formula id="14">\[  N_{ij} = n_i n_j = \frac{ F^{-1}_{Ii} N_{I} J dA_0 \times F^{-1}_{Jj} N_{J} J dA_0} { \| F^{-1}_{Ki} N_{K} J
dA_0 \|^2 }
\]</formula> </para>
