The inverse of the deformation gradient is defined as:   <formula id="15">\[ \boldsymbol{F}^{-1}
\]</formula> The derivative of <formula id="16">$\boldsymbol{F}^{-1}$</formula> with respect to <formula id="1">$\boldsymbol{F}$</formula> is given by:   <formula id="17">\[ \frac{\partial F^{-1}_{iK}}{\partial F_{jL}} = - F^{-1}_{iL} F^{-1}_{jK}
